      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get the uric acid part. so basically if the surplus isn't used for growth it just gets wasted. are there any specific micronutrients or hormonal factors that act like \"gatekeepers\" for this process? like things that can block the signal or make the whole pathway less efficient even if leucine levels are high?",
